[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2581.109, "timestamp": "00:43:01", "text": "像重型底座那样的底座。是的。根据。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2582.8, "timestamp": "00:43:02", "text": "根据。 呃，基地。有一个。蓝色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2584.88, "timestamp": "00:43:04", "text": "呃，基地。有一个。蓝色 标记物是基础。我已经扔了一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2587.2, "timestamp": "00:43:07", "text": "标记物是基础。我已经扔了一个 秩序。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2589.04, "timestamp": "00:43:09", "text": "秩序。 各位，我看到尸体了。这是你吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2591.04, "timestamp": "00:43:11", "text": "各位，我看到尸体了。这是你吗？ 伙计们？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2593.68, "timestamp": "00:43:13", "text": "伙计们？ 或许。或许不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2601.19, "timestamp": "00:43:21", "text": "好的，我离提取物很近，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2609.19, "timestamp": "00:43:29", "text": "提取物在哪？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2610.83, "timestamp": "00:43:30", "text": "我懂了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2612.55, "timestamp": "00:43:32", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2613.91, "timestamp": "00:43:33", "text": "我们必须进入这个基地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2616.39, "timestamp": "00:43:36", "text": "手动操作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2619.51, "timestamp": "00:43:39", "text": "DSS。哦，DSS 又恢复正常了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2621.99, "timestamp": "00:43:41", "text": "是的，DSS已经修好了。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2631.109, "timestamp": "00:43:51", "text": "好的。我讨厌这种感觉，就像天生的一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2633.349, "timestamp": "00:43:53", "text": "这种现象是因为它是真正的尼泊尔。"}]